<title>ESTONIA: HANSAPANK TO LOWER MORE BANKING FEES.</title>
<headline>HANSAPANK TO LOWER MORE BANKING FEES.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hansapank, Estonia's largest bank, said on Friday that it will lower more of its service fees from June 2.</p>
<p>In a statement, the bank said that it was lowering various fees, including for foreign currency transactions.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
</text>
